  "prefLabel": "Fam 604.06 Role-Play",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-10-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fam 604.06 Role-Play.\n\n(a) Each basic course as described in Fam 604.02 shall include at least 10 hours of role-play inclusive of at least one hour in domestic violence screening as described in Fam 604.02(c)(2)e.\n\n(b) At least 3 student participants shall be included in each instance of role-play except those instances in which the role-play teaches:\n\n(1) How to caucus; or\n\n(2) Domestic violence screening.\n\n(c) During role-play trainers shall supervise no more than:\n\n(1) One large group of 5 or more participating students; or\n\n(2) Two small groups of 4 or fewer students.\n\nSource. #9087, eff 2-16-08; ss by #9675, eff 4-2-10; ss by #12507, INTERIM, eff 4-2-18, EXPIRED: 10-1-18\n\nNew. #12637, eff 10-2-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fam100-800.html"
